OL,3,GNEWSATourists heard shots from Krakow
OL,4,Aattack in pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis article contains details some
OL,7,Freaders may find distressing
OL,9,FA couple holidaying in Poland have said
OL,10,Fthey heard the gunshots from the deadly
OL,11,Fattack in Krakow while they were in a
OL,12,Fnearby pub.
OL,14,FSix people were killed and more than a
OL,15,Fdozen injured on Saturday when a gunman
OL,16,Fopened fire in central Krakow. The
OL,17,Fsuspect, who also allegedly killed his
OL,18,Ffamily at home before opening fire, has
OL,19,Fdied in hospital.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
