OL,3,GNEWSATourists heard shots from Krakow
OL,4,Aattack in pub
OL,5,
OL,6,FHarley Bircher and his girlfriend
OL,7,FKelsey Millard, from Barrow, Cumbria,
OL,8,Fwere sitting in a pub when they heard
OL,9,Fthe gunshots and saw people running
OL,10,Faway with "faces full of panic".
